</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Standing for the Word of God,</l><l>Standing for the precious blood,</l><l>Following where the saints have trod,</l><l>Christian soldier, stand.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Stand ’mid Satan’s every wile,</l><l>Stand ’mid pleasure’s wanton smile,</l><l>Stand when error would beguile;</l><l>Christian soldier, stand.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Stand till ends life’s little day,</l><l>Stand for Jesus, come what may,</l><l>Stand and fight and watch and pray;</l><l>Christian soldier, stand.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
